# Learn more https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files
.idea
# dependencies
node_modules/

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
expo-env.d.ts

# Native
.kotlin/
*.orig.*
*.keystore
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision

# Metro
.metro-health-check*

# debug
npm-debug.*
yarn-debug.*
yarn-error.*

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

# local env files
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
# android/ 已提交进仓库（含手工改过的 Manifest/签名/折叠屏适配），CI 直接用它构建
# ios/ 仍由 expo prebuild 在 CI 上生成
/ios
*.apk

# 音频由 scripts/sync-android-audio.js 从 assets/audio 复制而来，不重复入库
android/app/src/main/assets/audio/

# 调试签名是公开的通用密钥，允许入库；正式签名密钥绝不入库
!android/app/debug.keystore
